            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "One shall entrust the heat control to you, Traveler."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7050001",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Cloud Retainer",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "705000101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "705000101": {
            "id": "705000101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "The azure trees stand tall amid the snowy scene, the land is lonely and tranquil. Verily does one's third dish suit this atmosphere.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705000102"
            ]
          },
          "705000102": {
            "id": "705000102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What kind of dish are you going to make this time?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705000103"
            ]
          },
          "705000103": {
            "id": "705000103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "Well. Have you ever heard tell of a method known as \"braising\"? This technique did one discover upon reading through some culinary tomes.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705000104"
            ]
          },
          "705000104": {
            "id": "705000104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "A fancy did one take to it, and thus created a new recipe, \"Braised Meat,\" with this culinary technique as its heart.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705000105"
            ]
          },
          "705000105": {
            "id": "705000105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "Now, this dish is hardly too tall a task for one's Supreme Cuisine Machine, but meat is key to this dish, and none but the best shall one have.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705000106"
            ]
          },
          "705000106": {
            "id": "705000106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "Thus did one activate a mechanism and pursue the scent of fine ingredients to this place.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705000107"
            ]
          },
          "705000107": {
            "id": "705000107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "The snow and wind drive hard here, and makes for slow work.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705000108"
            ]
          },
          "705000108": {
            "id": "705000108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "One is aware, Traveler, of your wealth of adventuring experience. Surely, then, a mere snowy mountain will prove no obstacle to you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705000109"
            ]
          },
          "705000109": {
            "id": "705000109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "One thus requests that you go forthwith and retrieve some ingredients once more.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705000111",
              "705000117"
            ]
          },
          "705000111": {
            "id": "705000111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "Your aid shall not be forgotten. For the completion of this errand shall one await you here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705000112"
            ]
          },
          "705000112": {
            "id": "705000112",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "Hmm. The mechanism has come to a halt. 'Tis must be the biting cold.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705000113"
            ]
          },
          "705000113": {
            "id": "705000113",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "Allow one to restart it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705000114"
            ]
          },
          "705000114": {
            "id": "705000114",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "Supreme Cuisine Machine... activate!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705000115"
            ]
          },
          "705000115": {
            "id": "705000115",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "This should resolve the issue. Now then, Traveler, pursue the scent one has put you on and retrieve those ingredients."
          },
          "705000117": {
            "id": "705000117",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "Nonsense! How daring of you, to gainsay one's adeptal might! One is merely... occupied repairing these devices!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705000118"
            ]
          },
          "705000118": {
            "id": "705000118",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "Depart now. One grows impatient."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7050002",
      "subQuestName": "Follow the aura trail and find the ingredients",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "705000201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "705000201": {
            "id": "705000201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "How goes your search? Secured the ingredients one desires, have you?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7050003",
      "subQuestName": "Report back to Cloud Retainer",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "705000301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "705000301": {
            "id": "705000301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "Well? Is the Braised Meat complete?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7050007",
      "subQuestName": "Report back to Cloud Retainer",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "705000501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "705000501": {
            "id": "705000501",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "...What manner of morsel is this?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705000502"
            ]
          },
          "705000502": {
            "id": "705000502",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "They call it Chilled Meat.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705000503"
            ]
          },
          "705000503": {
            "id": "705000503",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "Chilled Meat... An apt name indeed.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705000504"
            ]
          },
          "705000504": {
            "id": "705000504",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "It is of fair quality, too. Still, we shall need a small fire to thaw it out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705000505"
            ]
          },
          "705000505": {
            "id": "705000505",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "Fortunately, defrosting counts among the Supreme Cuisine Machine's functions.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705000507",
              "705000513"
            ]
          },
          "705000507": {
            "id": "705000507",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "Ah! Falsehoods. This device does not lack for missing functions. The ability to automatically gather ingredients, for one. Or automatic heat control, for that matter... one could go on.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705000508"
            ]
          },
          "705000508": {
            "id": "705000508",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "Many improvements still must one make to it in the coming days.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705000509"
            ]
          },
          "705000509": {
            "id": "705000509",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "We shall cease the idle talk there. The ingredients are prepared, one shall activate this device immediately.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705000510"
            ]
          },
          "705000510": {
            "id": "705000510",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "The heat control shall still be left in your hands, Traveler.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705000511"
            ]
          },
          "705000511": {
            "id": "705000511",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "One would have you report your readiness once you are sufficiently prepared."
          },
          "705000513": {
            "id": "705000513",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "One would prefer that you saved that praise for the Supreme Cuisine Machine's faculties."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7050009",
      "subQuestName": "Report back to Cloud Retainer",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "705000901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "705000901": {
            "id": "705000901",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Yep, I'm ready.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705000902"
            ]
          },
          "705000902": {
            "id": "705000902",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "Then let us begin.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705000903"
            ]
          },
          "705000903": {
            "id": "705000903",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "Supreme Cuisine Machine... activate!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7050010",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "705001001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "705001001": {
            "id": "705001001",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'm not ready yet.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705001002"
            ]
          },
          "705001002": {
            "id": "705001002",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "Hmm. Ready yourself, then, and inform one once it is so."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7050004",
      "subQuestName": "Help Cloud Retainer complete the dish",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "705000401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "705000401": {
            "id": "705000401",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "One could not call the heat control desirable..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
